.SS "\fBTriple\fP SystemEx\&.Algorithms\&.NetStdCompare< T >\&.Compare (Optional< T > a, Optional< T > b)"

.PP
Returns \fBtriple\&.True\fP if A is strictly smaller than B, \fBtriple\&.False\fP if A is strictly greater than B, and \fBtriple\&.Nin\fP if both values are equal\&. Comparison is only performed when both optionals contain valid, non-null values\&. If either optional is null, the comparison is undefined and this method returns \fBtriple\&.Nin\fP\&. 
